    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "cbb6bd50-511b-39b4-8711-6f95fcbacf22",
                "word": "quango",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "da93fe1e-6aa9-4ec8-aedd-4cbed8c14504",
                        "entry_id": "cbb6bd50-511b-39b4-8711-6f95fcbacf22",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "quangos"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd19b6c4-2db8-3808-a1d4-d9918dfb94e8",
                        "entry_id": "cbb6bd50-511b-39b4-8711-6f95fcbacf22",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An organization that, although financed by a government, acts independently of it."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK",
                            "derogatory",
                            "often"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "715ab09f-9627-4f70-b4a9-dd3f37d58008",
                                "sense_id": "cd19b6c4-2db8-3808-a1d4-d9918dfb94e8",
                                "text": "The strongest link to the State, however, occurs with quangos, (quasi-NGOs), and the many umbrella groups that also thrive on State support. Many of the new parties realized after their Sturm und Drang years that they still needed regular contacts with the 'civil' world and that their civilian support base had been seriously eroded."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9d74b74-251e-41c5-8c36-683438ca6df0",
                                "sense_id": "cd19b6c4-2db8-3808-a1d4-d9918dfb94e8",
                                "text": "Various state committees and quangos had had stands; government and opposition ministers had attended."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b886a79c-9398-49c4-9323-7f6e6dbe98f2",
                        "source_entry_id": "cbb6bd50-511b-39b4-8711-6f95fcbacf22",
                        "source_sense_id": "cd19b6c4-2db8-3808-a1d4-d9918dfb94e8",
                        "source_sense_description": "organization that, although financed by a government, acts independently of it",
                        "target_lang_word": "autorité administrative indépendante",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "autorité administrative indépendante",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11d88cc1-3625-34e7-8c4b-08334f1b03ce",
                                        "entry_id": "8081ac68-bf85-348a-b604-e248741e1460",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Organisme administratif placé hors de la hiérarchie ordinaire de l'administration et doté du pouvoir de prendre par lui-même des décisions administratives dans un domaine particulier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2937866c-7435-4c66-8a70-c0e5d1a9f4fd",
                                                "sense_id": "11d88cc1-3625-34e7-8c4b-08334f1b03ce",
                                                "text": "Ces autorités administratives indépendantes, notamment vis-à-vis des pouvoirs publics, ont essentiellement un rôle de contre-pouvoir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "853f4ef3-68ad-4f9d-8de2-0a6ed594da34",
                                                "sense_id": "11d88cc1-3625-34e7-8c4b-08334f1b03ce",
                                                "text": "Comme en France, l’affaire serait confiée à une autorité administrative indépendante, l’Ofcom, l’équivalent local [britannique] du CSA et de l’Arcep."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ccd3841-2b45-47ef-a9aa-89ec226955af",
                                                "sense_id": "11d88cc1-3625-34e7-8c4b-08334f1b03ce",
                                                "text": "La Commission nationale de l'informatique et des libertés (CNIL), établie en 1978, est la première autorité administrative indépendante française."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c3ddc08-2889-3968-8451-9c6b72fe718e",
                                        "entry_id": "8081ac68-bf85-348a-b604-e248741e1460",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Autorité administrative indépendante (sens 1) qui n'est pas dotée de sa propre personnalité juridique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "note": "En ce sens, s’oppose à autorité publique indépendante",
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1d4bc0b-c131-4687-bb18-a5d890891d1b",
                                                "sense_id": "7c3ddc08-2889-3968-8451-9c6b72fe718e",
                                                "text": "La distinction entre autorité administrative indépendante et autorité publique indépendante est rappelée (article 2 de la proposition de loi ordinaire), les secondes disposant de la personnalité morale, sans que la proposition de loi ne modifie la qualification d’API au profit de celle d’AAI."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
